{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>That opens every womb.</b> That the womb opened first — as in ״פּוֹטֵר מַיִם רֵאשִׁית מָדוֹן״ (Proverbs 17), and likewise ״יַפְטִירוּ בְשָׂפָה״ (Psalms 22) — they open the lips." "<b>Mine they are.</b> For Myself I acquired them, through My striking the firstborn of Egypt."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:51:53.149224565Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}